  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><strong>！警告！</strong></span></p><p>该模组已取消。因此，不会再有后续更新。</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wY0GYSM.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/wY0GYSM.png\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1080\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">本模组是 Fanon Mutant Entities 的官方 1.19.2 版本</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">1.16.5&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fanon-mutant-entities\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fanon Mutant Entities - 模组 - Minecraft - CurseForge</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>（原始模组：</p><p>~1.7.10&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-creatures-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mutant Creatures Mod - 模组 - Minecraft - CurseForge</a></p><p>1.12.2~1.16.5&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-beasts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mutant Beasts - 模组 - Minecraft - CurseForge<br></a>1.18.2~&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-monsters\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mutant Monsters [Forge &amp; Fa... - 模组 - Minecraft - CurseForge</a>）</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">本模组需要 GeckoLib</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">变异生物列表</span><br><br>失败等级（LV FAILED）</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>等级 1（LV 1）</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br>等级 2（LV 2）</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YZreorH.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/YZreorH.png\" width=\"261\" height=\"540\"></p>\n<p>- 愤怒垂钓者（Angry Angler）</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>等级 3（LV 3）</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K8nvOKV.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/K8nvOKV.png\" width=\"249\" height=\"519\">- 无魂斗士（Soulless Champion）</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
